---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Legal title="Privacy Policy">
  <p><em>Review and customise with your business details before going live. This is a starting point, not legal advice.</em></p>

  <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Purchase email:</strong> the email you provide at checkout, used to deliver your download link and receipt.</li>
    <li><strong>Order details:</strong> the project purchased, amount, and payment reference from Razorpay.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> the name, email and message you submit via the contact form.</li>
    <li><strong>Basic technical data:</strong> standard server logs and, where enabled, privacy-friendly bot protection (Cloudflare Turnstile).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. What we do not collect</h2>
  <p>We never see or store your card numbers, UPI IDs, or banking credentials — these are handled entirely by Razorpay. We do not sell your data.</p>

  <h2>3. How we use your data</h2>
  <p>To process orders, deliver digital files, provide support, prevent abuse, and comply with legal obligations. We only use your email to fulfil your request and, if you opt in, to send occasional project updates.</p>

  <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
  <p>We rely on <strong>Razorpay</strong> (payments), <strong>Cloudflare</strong> (hosting, storage and security), and affiliate stores you choose to visit. Each has its own privacy policy governing data they process.</p>

  <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
  <p>Order records are retained as required for accounting and support. You may request deletion of your contact messages and personal data where we are not legally required to keep them.</p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us. We will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

  <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
  <p>We use only essential cookies (for security and session integrity, such as CSRF protection). We do not use third-party advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy requests, reach us via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or at {SITE.email}.</p>
</Legal>
